{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>For</b> — The word [refers to] their coming with evil thoughts that they plot all night long. And behold, their heart is like an oven; only every baker sleeps at night, and only in the morning kindles the oven — but these, their heart does not sleep; rather, it plots all night long."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:27.292311197Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}